[
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769174947.8063738",
    "text": "Mirror the part according to the plane lying on the not rounded end of the part. Merge the mirrored part together with the existing one so they create one body.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769174995.910249",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769174995.910249.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769175834.340082.step",
      "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1770179410.510611.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771138834.8028932.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769175216.745646",
    "text": "Design cylindrical bearing on the flat end of the part (the one without fillet). Create another 7 instances of this design and rotate them around the bearing axis.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769175266.4731915",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769175266.4731915.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769176057.004533.step",
      "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1770186722.92591.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script": "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script_1771030783.999739.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771141424.7459352.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769175629.871246",
    "text": "Multiply amount of cylindrical feature to 4. Imagine this is a system of plant pots, so you need to add stability to that afterwards by adding another legs or ribs on the sides. ",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769175693.6429307",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769175693.6429307.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769176584.041443.step",
      "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1770180042.853617.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771140208.912489.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771541391.446292.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769176912.388391",
    "text": "Add cylindrical pin into the bearing area of the part, so it is able to rotate around it.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769176939.9727383",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769176939.9727383.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "SUJ2G2UMJQR7PMBX_1770201876.485464.step",
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769177662.483708.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771056330.0941188.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769177020.525719",
    "text": "Add several cutouts into the part to decrease its weight.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769177042.368274",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769177042.368274.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "SUJ2G2UMJQR7PMBX_1770181134.858264.step",
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769177940.308554.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script": "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script_1771003363.1284611.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771057688.341952.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771627287.467016.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769177116.6129558",
    "text": "Design simple locking mechanism in the area of the hook to secure carried load.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769177138.614976",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769177138.614976.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "SUJ2G2UMJQR7PMBX_1770201493.8573298.step",
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769178755.560677.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771057445.667226.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769773134.1453462",
    "text": "Add bigger amount of cylindrical holes into the red platforms to decrease their weights. Amount of patterns can be chosen by editor.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769773186.6917107",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769773186.6917107.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "DYP2J9CYL7X46RLQ_1770179259.833334.step",
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769775710.843203.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script": "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script_1771042793.932074.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771172420.619678.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771566631.1235142.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769773335.525203",
    "text": "Add cylindrical heads on the long pins to prevent link arms against slipping off.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769773358.5396488",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769773358.5396488.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "DYP2J9CYL7X46RLQ_1770187029.628212.step",
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769776990.4257011.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script": "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script_1771043690.891785.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771173812.813165.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771567425.6545842.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769773481.491738",
    "text": "Change the shape of the profile of link arms to the shape of long hole to increase its stifness. Then change the diameter of the holes by 1mm and adjust the shape accordingly.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769773529.430728",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769773529.430728.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "DYP2J9CYL7X46RLQ_1770182226.242806.step",
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769778363.131156.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771173598.736021.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769779150.98797",
    "text": "Imagine the black handle is a stand. Add another one on the other side of device in approximately same distane from side wall as the existing one. Remove the Cordholder. Cut the bottom of the handles so it allows the device to be stable on a flat surface.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769779221.0033863",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769779221.0033863.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769783231.5078888.step",
      "SUJ2G2UMJQR7PMBX_1770350909.101281.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771097091.219999.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769782403.586036",
    "text": "Change the current plug for Europlug with two round pins and try to copy the real shape.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769782430.5654984",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769782430.5654984.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "SUJ2G2UMJQR7PMBX_1770352544.57821.step",
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1770282363.071411.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771097959.1147761.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769783385.069543",
    "text": "Remove the collision between handle and cofeepot.",
    "brep_start": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769783424.5735083",
    "brep_path": "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769783424.5735083.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "3YH2WFSRM22W7DKT_1769784307.245124.step",
      "SUJ2G2UMJQR7PMBX_1770351283.911096.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771098983.927537.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771471391.829973.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737060.465216",
    "text": "Change that vertical slot to cut through complete body to decrease weight",
    "brep_start": "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737088.581102",
    "brep_path": "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737088.581102.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737364.5100071.step",
      "SUJ2G2UMJQR7PMBX_1759745543.117889.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script": "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script_1770985276.916856.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771006061.635123.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771007318.3854039.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737118.288898",
    "text": "Insert screws to both holes to be able to fix tool on the table",
    "brep_start": "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737140.5304155",
    "brep_path": "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737140.5304155.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "SUJ2G2UMJQR7PMBX_1760005565.354083.step",
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1759907508.509569.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script": "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script_1770986055.487199.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771008954.311071.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737238.499021",
    "text": "Design a fixation rod mounted from the top with arm length 200mm to have ability to fix cutting product",
    "brep_start": "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737277.9100277",
    "brep_path": "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737277.9100277.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1758737863.425611.step",
      "SUJ2G2UMJQR7PMBX_1759819510.1979048.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771006663.395092.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771007849.4950569.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758863141.735564",
    "text": "Add a 2 millimetre fillet to the edges of the scrolling wheel slot to ensure a smooth surface.",
    "brep_start": "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758863189.5437753",
    "brep_path": "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758863189.5437753.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1759932719.14223.step",
      "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758860219.557066.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771011927.188559.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771013445.783168.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758863286.214549",
    "text": "Add two click buttons with the height of 2 millimetre to provide a comfortable and responsive feel for the user",
    "brep_start": "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758863329.0408635",
    "brep_path": "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758863329.0408635.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1759933372.0768251.step",
      "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758860663.6610408.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771013071.300748.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771015220.639067.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758863403.376244",
    "text": "Add a sliding switch on the bottom to provide a convenient on and off function",
    "brep_start": "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758863449.911907",
    "brep_path": "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758863449.911907.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "4S7JQK6ZQMAD25GL_1758861187.827584.step",
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1759933848.352789.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771014068.0798788.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770166308.11235",
    "text": "If this is a spanner, the main cutout is too deep which is weakening the tool. Make the cutout shallower by 10mm, but keep the \"size\" of the spanner the same - meaning the parallel surfaces remain 20mm apart.",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770166417.8141372",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770166417.8141372.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1770281761.222699.step",
      "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770166566.935083.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771135676.064883.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771537431.9002838.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770166901.871316",
    "text": "Use geometry of cylindrical hole defined in Sketch4 for creating inscribed hexagonal polygonal to the original hole and make it through all cutout instead.",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770166985.8713312",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770166985.8713312.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1770283886.304938.step",
      "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770167138.529792.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771138136.368067.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770167800.9857888",
    "text": "Make the part symmetrical with respect to ZX plane by adding lowered plateau to the bottom. Then add embossed text to the top to distinguish the top (text should be \"TOP\", Arial, 10mm height, 1mm raised above lowered plateau, not sticking out of the plateau, approximately centered to the middle).",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770167964.8837814",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770167964.8837814.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1770284176.012213.step",
      "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770168158.647497.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771137533.972336.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771538676.6760478.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770169445.8914912",
    "text": "Add chamfer to main/biggest cylindrical section of Heatbreak body/component. The chamfer should be same size as present on top of the part, but should be added to the lower edge of the cylinder. This should allow easier insertion of the part during assembly.",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770169581.2959814",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770169581.2959814.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "EHM2HMQDME2U85QB_1770276190.115674.step",
      "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770169670.772366.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771169537.281322.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770169718.2982779",
    "text": "Reduce overall height of Nozzle Volcano part by 1mm, reduction should be made in threaded area.",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770169768.2317266",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770169768.2317266.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770169872.203006.step",
      "EHM2HMQDME2U85QB_1770273882.8047261.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771171306.787411.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770169975.851399",
    "text": "Change mounting system at the back of Cyclops Plus Heatsink from 3-point mounting version to 4-points, similar to that which is found at the back of Cyclops Aqua Block.",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770170092.2686632",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770170092.2686632.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770170732.361324.step",
      "EHM2HMQDME2U85QB_1770274274.016923.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771170958.1093462.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771565215.7525382.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770171470.1448698",
    "text": "Make the whole frame structure taller by 0,5cm. The area profile remains the same.",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770171513.0662978",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770171513.0662978.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770171604.36757.step",
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1770298553.736796.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771051696.241556.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771513001.141396.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770171700.697783",
    "text": "Remove the largest radius that is all around the part and replace it by the same size radius as others. That means in cross section all radiuses will be the same for the profile.",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770171784.1490738",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770171784.1490738.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1770298949.912307.step",
      "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770171866.426871.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771055489.714899.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770172545.5244548",
    "text": "If edge with bigger radius is considered as top, add supporting structure to the bottom of the frame by offseting inner wall by 2cm with thickness of 0,5cm of the supporting structure all around. This will create step at the bottom of the frame, enlarging bottom surface area. Leave out radii at the bottom edges. Add radii from top, 0,2cm which will create smoothe transition from above. Bottom remains flat.",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770172740.6096544",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770172740.6096544.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770172865.2628522.step",
      "4E22SJE7QVTSP2E3_1770299808.387549.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771054198.838351.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770174133.012106",
    "text": "Prolong black lever sticking out to the front by 5cm for better manipulation.",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770174182.8249135",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770174182.8249135.step",
