    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771095465.3783832.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771468943.2606652.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770174519.556716",
    "text": "Add rectangular openining to the lower back of the coffee machine, which might serve as draft location for plug and main ON/OFF switch. Opening should be 20cm x 10cm and 3cm deep rectangle with roundend corners (radius 1cm). Position should be more or less equally distanced from bottom and sides of the device.",
    "brep_start": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770174682.209837",
    "brep_path": "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770174682.209837.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "B7A2N74ZJBF9MZHU_1770174801.8832462.step",
      "SUJ2G2UMJQR7PMBX_1770278434.417848.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771093391.272267.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1769424096.996583",
    "text": "Add rounds to all edges of the part. R=0,2mm",
    "brep_start": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1769424114.3880424",
    "brep_path": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1769424114.3880424.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "DYP2J9CYL7X46RLQ_1770274796.578121.step",
      "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1769424844.610955.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script": "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script_1771001155.412163.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771049140.7546518.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771441606.386515.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1769607142.566352",
    "text": "Add third rotor blade to the assembly. It should have the same design as the other two. Radii should applied on all four long edges of the blade. Adjust central portion of all three blades so that there is a space for a new blade - reduce thickness of the central portion to cca 0,42mm. New blade should go through the center of the stack.",
    "brep_start": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1769607241.221253",
    "brep_path": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1769607241.221253.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1769608193.091736.step",
      "DYP2J9CYL7X46RLQ_1770264376.3208.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771089547.5143418.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771465311.332684.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1770204558.429523",
    "text": "One of the long edges of the blade does not have a radius. Add radius to that long edge R=0,635cm",
    "brep_start": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1770204569.6643417",
    "brep_path": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1770204569.6643417.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1770204605.599328.step",
      "DYP2J9CYL7X46RLQ_1770263010.379529.step"
    ],
    "model_brep_end": {
      "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script": "claude-sonnet-4.5_cadquery-script_1771013868.2541041.step",
      "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script": "gpt-5.2_cadquery-script_1771086666.680623.step",
      "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script": "gemini-3-pro_cadquery-script_1771464028.948576.step"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1770204696.542443",
    "text": "Create two cover parts, that have matching outer shape to the outer contour of the central part, sit flush on its outer surface and its counterpart on the other side and have thickness of 0,254cm",
    "brep_start": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1770204704.7150607",
    "brep_path": "F332D3FXML85WLR2_1770204704.7150607.step",
    "brep_end": [
      "DYP2J9CYL7X46RLQ_1770280051.274079.step",
